# claude: the root .gitignore's broad "_*"/"*.o"/"*.d"/"*.sym"/"*.asm"
# patterns already cover most of this directory's own build output, but
# not these specific bare names. Scoped here rather than at the repo root
# so the patterns stay narrow - "fs.img" in particular is a name this
# repo has in several places, and only THIS one plus ../source/fs.img
# (the copy of it the kernel embeds - see the fork-level .gitignore) are
# build output.
/fs.img
/mkfs
/initcode
/initcode.out
